    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62982" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστ-ήριον</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾳστήριον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>band of
			robbers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.191
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3
			</span></i> P.<i><span class="en">
				59
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>: in pl., <i>piratical vessels</i>,
				Clidem.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.219
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ilion</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>retreat</i> or <i>nest of robbers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				581.52
			</span></i> (Crete, <span class="entity">iii/ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.1.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>robbery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cont.</u>
				11
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾳστήριοι</span> (
				Dor.
			), οἱ, <i>pirates</i>, metaph.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Axiop.
				6
			</span></i>.</div>
